---
import InstructionNote from '../InstructionNote.astro';
---
<section id="imagery">
    <h2>Imagery</h2>
    

    <h3>Multimedia Policies</h3>
    <ul>
        <li><strong>Text in Images:</strong> New York Times cooking uses mostly text in code and advises against text in an image because it is not adaptable or screenreader friendly.</li>
        <li><strong>Video & Audio:</strong> Any videos or audio content must include closed captions and/or a transcript.</li>
        <li><strong>Motion Control:</strong> Any item that flashes must not flash more than 3 times. Additionally animated or auto-playing elements should include a pause button.</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Alt-Text Style Guide</h3>
    <div class="image-grid">
        <div>
            <div class="placeholder-box" style="min-height: 200px;">
                <img src = "public/soup.png"></img>
            </div>
            <p><strong>Alt-Text:</strong> "[Write descriptive alt text here for a complex/functional image]"</p>
        </div>
        <div>
            <div class="placeholder-box" style="min-height: 200px;">
                <img src = "public/chick.png"></img>
            </div>
            <p><strong>Alt-Text:</strong> "[Write descriptive alt text here for a decorative/ambient image]"</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>